\tensor;
# tensor.src - implementation provider for the Core type `Tensor`.
#
# Loaded only by an explicit import:
#   \tensor(...)           - package next to the source / in TRUST_PACKAGE_PATH
#   \\\tensor(...)         - toolchain package (share/trust/tensor.trust)
#
# `Tensor = ...` attaches the implementation (C++ type, header, link requirement) to the
# pre-declared built-in type; `::=` is not used. The public header is self-contained (no
# libtorch types); the backend is the `tensor_cpu` toolchain plugin, declared by
# [[artifact]] in trust.toml. The logical link requirement `tensor` resolves to
# the plugin library (-ltensor_cpu).

@[include("@stdlib/tensor.hpp")@]
@[link("tensor")@]
Tensor = %trust::Tensor {
    rank^(): Int64 := %rank ...;
    size^(): Int64 := %size ...;
    shape^() := %shape ...;
    at^(i: Int64): TemplateParam := %at ...;
};
